# Sent with every page and file of the app (Cloudflare reads this file; it isn't served).
# Audit, 23 Nov 2026: other websites may not show the app inside a frame (people sign in here),
# browsers mustn't guess file types, and other sites see only our address, never a page's.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
